[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m2. A narrative question — hybrid search, rerank, cited generation\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.009, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/ask -d '{\"question\": \"What are the risks of the Umpqua merger?\"}'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.519, "o", "  route      \u001b[32msemantic\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m· no complete (concept, company, period) key — falls back to search\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "  Based on the provided filings, the risks associated with the Umpqua\r\n  merger include:\r\n  \r\n  * **Acquisition and Integration Risks:** The combination may not\r\n  produce anticipated positive results, such as correctly assessing\r\n  the quality of acquired assets, the total cost of integration\r\n  (including management attention and resources), the time required\r\n  for successful integration, the amount of longer-term cost savings,\r\n  the ability to profitably deploy acquired funds, or the overall\r\n  performance of the combined entity [1][2].\r\n  * **Risks If the Merger Agreement is Terminated:**\r\n    * Umpqua’s businesses could be adversely impacted by failing to\r\n  pursue other beneficial opportunities due to management's focus on\r\n  the transaction without realizing anticipated benefits [4][5][6].\r\n    * The expected benefit of significant internal resources devoted\r\n  to the pursuit of the merger would be lost [4][5][6].\r\n    * Umpqua's common stock price could decline if current market\r\n  prices reflect "]
[0.000, "o", "an assumption that the merger will close [4][5][6].\r\n    * Under certain circumstances, Umpqua may be required to pay a\r\n  termination fee of $145.0 million to Columbia [4][5][6].\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mcitations\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m(every [n] above resolves to a real filing)\u001b[0m\r\n   \u001b[33m[1]\u001b[0m COLB 10-K 2023-02-24  \u001b[2mItem 1A. RISK FACTORS\u001b[0m\r\n       \u001b[2mhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/887343/000088734323000072/colb-20221231.htm\u001b[0m\r\n   \u001b[33m[2]\u001b[0m COLB 10-K 2022-02-25  \u001b[2mItem 1A. RISK FACTORS\u001b[0m\r\n       \u001b[2mhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/887343/000088734322000038/colb-20211231.htm\u001b[0m\r\n   \u001b[33m[4]\u001b[0m UMPQ 10-K 2023-02-24  \u001b[2mItem 1A. RISK FACTORS.\u001b[0m\r\n       \u001b[2mhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1077771/000107777123000012/umpq-20221231.htm\u001b[0m\r\n   \u001b[33m[5]\u001b[0m UMPQ 10-K 2022-02-25  \u001b[2mItem 1A. RISK FACTORS.\u001b[0m\r\n       \u001b[2mhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1077771/000107777122000011/umpq-20211231.htm\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[32m4446.3 ms\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m— 6 reranked passages, 1 model call\u001b[0m\r\n"]
